  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your divine bond with a celestial spirit has a longer-lasting effect on your weapon.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Divine bond class feature with the celestial spirit option, Cha 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you call a celestial spirit to bond with your weapon, the spirit remains for an additional number of minutes equal to your Charisma bonus. All other effects and benefits of the divine bond class feature remain the same.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Your divine bond lasts for 1 minute per paladin level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alternate-justicar#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
